			"Message": "style(Rest): Add inter-statement whitespace to launcher\n\nReintroduce blank lines between import declarations, variable assignments, and control flow blocks in bin/Rest.js to improve visual separation and readability.\n\nEach logical section — imports, platform detection, binary path resolution, existence check, and execution — is now delineated by a blank line. This mirrors the prior formatting style before the whitespace removal in 4d6034b and aids scanning during maintenance.\n\nNo functional changes; binary resolution, error reporting, and process exit behavior are preserved.",
